msgid "Native navigation refers to keyboard commands handled by the application, such as Tab, Page Up, Page Down, and Enter."
msgstr "Egen navigering hänvisar till tangentbordskommandon som hanteras av programmet, såsom Tabb, Page Up, Page Down och Retur."

